                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I am crippled and can't stand or walk without crutches. The developer of this game has been determined to make it handicapped accessible. When it first launched it had a LOT of problems. I have worked with the dev to fix them. I now feel this is one of the most accessible FPS VR games on steam for me using my power chair. He added a head height slider, short rang grab beam to pick items up. as well as a 45 degree world rotation left and right. And implemented the popular movement system found in the game Onward.",
